{# The three steps of the creation wizard.

   Numbered because here the order genuinely carries information: the source decides what step 2 is
   able to offer. A clone of a cloud-init template can be named and addressed before it first boots;
   an ISO installation cannot be configured at all, and step 2 changes shape accordingly.

   This file used to draw the row itself, in a near-copy of the application's own stepper. It no
   longer does: it holds the step names and hands them to _wizard_steps.html.twig, the one every
   other wizard uses - which also gives this one the progress bar and the "Étape 2 sur 3" caption
   the copy never had. #}
{% include '_wizard_steps.html.twig' with {
    stepLabels: [
        'proxmoxWizardSourceStep'|trans,
        'proxmoxWizardMachineStep'|trans,
        'proxmoxWizardSummaryStep'|trans,
    ],
    currentStepIndex: step,
} only %}
